{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7v8z47xo","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":47,"title":"Haushaltsarbeit","nativeTitle":"Housework","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Inge","Nico"],"speakerGenders":{"Inge":"female","Nico":"male"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Danke für deine Hilfe!","native":"Thanks for your help!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Mhm.","native":"Mhm."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Nico? Möchtest du lieber abwaschen ?","native":"Nico? Would you rather wash the dishes?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Abwaschen?","native":"Wash the dishes?"},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Spülen, das Geschirr spülen .","native":"Rinsing, rinsing the dishes."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ja, ich möchte lieber abwaschen.","native":"Yes, I'd rather wash the dishes."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Charmant, der junge Mann.","native":"Charming, the young man."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Hä?","native":"Huh?"},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Ach, nichts. Fang du dort an, ich mache hier weiter.","native":"Oh, nothing. You start over there, I'll continue here."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Nico? Alles in Ordnung ?","native":"Nico? Is everything all right?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Entschuldigung!","native":"Sorry!"},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Kein Problem. Ich hole den Staubsauger . Ich sauge nicht so oft. Ich hasse Hausarbeit : abwaschen, abtrocknen , kochen, staubsaugen , waschen, putzen! Und dann alles wieder von vorn? Furchtbar!","native":"No problem. I'll get the vacuum cleaner. I don't vacuum that often. I hate housework: washing dishes, drying dishes, cooking, vacuuming, doing laundry, cleaning! And then everything all over again? Terrible!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ich mag Hausarbeit auch nicht.","native":"I don't like housework either."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Ach, ich hab keine Beutel mehr. Wo ist der Besen ? So. Hier: der Besen und das Kehrblech.","native":"Oh, I'm out of